            "Unwind @beachchillin30a, the most adorable townhome. With three bedrooms featuring two king beds, a full over full bunk bed, and a twin over twin bunk bed, there’s plenty of space for everyone. The three bathrooms include showers and handy hair dryers, making mornings easy and comfortable. Guests stay cozy year-round thanks to heating and AC throughout the home. Whether you’re gathering for a meal or relaxing after a day of adventure, this peaceful retreat offers a welcoming vibe. Kick back, relax, and enjoy everything 30a, Rosemary Beach, Seaside, Alys Beach, Grayton Beach and many other areas our townhome has to offer! The house comes with a new electric golf cart that'll make your trip to the beach or into Seaside, even funner!",
